                "text": "I am proud to join @RepLoisFrankel, @RepMariaSalazar, and @USRepKCastor as a co-lead on the Connected Maternal Online Monitoring (MOM) Act. This bill will address barriers to maternal health in remote areas and require the Centers for Medicare and Medicaid Services (CMS) to provide recommendations and resources to state Medicaid programs on how to increase coverage of devices that aid in remote monitoring.\n\nRead more here: https://t.co/qql5lilU0K",
